  "id": "effective-dose",
  "term": "effective dose",
  "definition": "In this context, effective dose means the amount and nature of an exercise program needed to produce a meaningful cognitive benefit. It includes not only physical exposure such as frequency, duration, volume, intensity, and program length, but may also involve the task’s cognitive and motor demands; the source notes that a precise cognitive exercise dose has not yet been established.",
